   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)><ac(20)>現在、<im(1)>我々は<im(3)>土星近海<im(2)>にいる。",
   "en": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)><ac(20)>Currently, <im(1)>we are <im(3)>in space near <im(2)>Saturn.",
   "notes": "Captain Bruno J. Global opening strategic briefing near Saturn."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63020#8",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 41,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(41,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)>数回に渡る#c[BE5050]ゼントラーディ#cの襲撃を\n退けられたのも、諸君らの活躍の\nおかげだと思っている。",
   "en": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)>We have repelled several #c[BE5050]Zentradi#c\nattacks, and I believe it is thanks to\nyour fine efforts.",
   "notes": "Global commending the fleet pilots."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63020#9",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 41,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(41,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[5E8FD8]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)>#c[5E8FD8]マクロス#cには民間人が大勢乗艦したままだ。\nお互いの力を合わせ、何としても\n無事に地球へ帰還しようではないか。",
   "en": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)>Many civilians remain aboard the #c[5E8FD8]Macross#c.\nLet us join our strength and return safely\nto Earth, no matter what it takes.",
   "notes": "Global stressing civilian protection."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63020#10",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 41,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(41,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(4)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "<im(13)>",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)>さて、ここからが本題だ。\n<im(4)>先ほど、レーダーに#c[BE5050]大規模な<im(13)>敵艦隊#cが\n観測された。",
   "en": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)>Now, to the main issue.\n<im(4)>Just now, radar detected a #c[BE5050]massive\n<im(13)>enemy fleet#c.",
   "notes": "Global outlining enemy fleet presence."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63020#11",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 41,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(41,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(11)>",
    "<im(14)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)>どうやら、これまでとは比べ物にならない\n<im(11)>規模<im(14)>の#c[BE5050]艦隊#cが待ち構えているようだ。",
   "en": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)>It appears that a force of unprecedented\n<im(11)>scale, an enemy <im(14)>#c[BE5050]fleet#c,\nis lying in wait for us.",
   "notes": "Global warning of massive fleet. Token order preserved."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63020#12",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 41,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(41,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(7)>",
    "<im(6)>",
    "<im(8)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)><im(7)><im(6)><im(8)>これまで以上の苦しい戦闘になることが\n予測される。だが、ここを突破しなければ\n帰還もまたありえない。",
   "en": "<op(41,1)><sp(2)><im(7)><im(6)><im(8)>We anticipate a battle harder than\nany before. But unless we break through,\nthere can be no return home.",
   "notes": "Global rallying the crew."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63020#13",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 41,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(41,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[F07141]",
    "#c"
